<title>UK: Bayerhypo sets $250 million two-year bond.</title>
<headline>Bayerhypo sets $250 million two-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager SBC Warburg.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BAYERISCHE HYPOTHEKEN- UND WECHSEL-BANK AG</p>
<p> AMT    $250 MLN	COUPON     6.0 PCT   MATURITY    06.MAY.99</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.175   PAY DATE    06.MAR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.125     REOFFER    100.20    SPREAD	+6 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AA2	 LISTING    LONDON</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA-	 SALE LIMITS US/UK/DE</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   TAX PROVS  STD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.15	SELL CONC  0.975</p>
<p> NOTES	SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
